'''Swirly Axe''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Main Event for 80,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It has two blades, resembling a labrys like [[Icebreaker]], with a red and white candy cane design, though the edge of the blades is silver. It has a peppermint with a swirly texture in the center of the axe, hence the name, encased in a silver crown, connecting the two blades to the axe. It also has a thin candy cane textured handle with a red bowtie, along with a bright red ruby placed in a fancy silver prong between the blades. 

== Trivia ==
* It was a victim of mass duping causing it to lose a lot of its value
* It is the 8th [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] weapon to be added into the game.
* It has a striking resemblance to another [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife under the name [[Icebreaker]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It is a part of a set with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Swirly Gun]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Swirly_Set Swirly Set].
*It is also part of the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Full_Swirly_Set Full Swirly Set], along with [[Swirly Gun]] and [[Swirly Blade]].
*There are [[Blue Swirly Axe|blue]], [[Bronze Swirly Axe|bronze]], [[Silver Swirly Axe|silver]], and [[Gold Swirly Axe|gold]] reskin variants of this knife, which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies for placing in the top 100 during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]].

